# Runner — Ground Logistics Unit
# Role: Extremely fast resource hauling.
# No weapons. Pure speed. Pure logistics.

type: mech
name: Runner

description: "A tiny, ultra-fast logistics drone on continuous treads. Designed for one thing: moving resources faster than anything else on the battlefield."

health: 180
armor: 1
speed: 3.2
hitSize: 8
rotateSpeed: 8
itemCapacity: 30

# Mech movement tuning — fast and responsive
mechStepParticles: true
mechFrontSway: 0.3
mechSideSway: 0.3
baseRotateSpeed: 5.0

# Flight / boost disabled — ground only
flying: false
canBoost: false

# AI: Mindustry auto-assigns logistics behavior based on itemCapacity

# No weapons — pure logistics unit
weapons: []

# Lightweight, fast-accelerating
accel: 0.12
drag: 0.04

# Research tree placement
research: velocity-protocol-velocity-ground-factory
